  "changelog": "Ruff package 0.1.0\n\nMinimum Cadencr application version: 0.16.1. This release publishes package assets only. Production marketplace catalog admission, the LSP revocation feed and the desktop release remain separate rollout steps.\n\nCanonical archive and runtime qualification: https://github.com/merkr-software/CadencR/actions/runs/42215738947\n\nPackaged binary deployment floors: macOS ARM 11.0.0, macOS Intel 10.12.0. Runtime qualification used macOS 15 on both architectures and Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 x86_64; older OS runtime certification and application OS support are separate.\n\n<!-- cadencr-publication-binding:sha256:2e2285afc83e1e5b9623b4a9f418bdc2d8b4bcda077e7c25aed215963a69e155 -->"
